BT 1 0 0 1 0 61.4 Tm 14 TL .101961 .172549 .258824 rg /F2+0 8.6 Tf 14 TL (ASTRA Health is a research-oriented demonstration of onboard health decision support for long-duration space) Tj T* (missions. Its primary operational concept is to help a crew measure, understand, act and communicate despite) Tj T* (delayed or interrupted Earth contact. The existing three-scenario prototype is supplemented by five FUTURE) Tj T* (modules for longitudinal health tracking, symptom assessment, broader health domains, extravehicular activity) Tj T* (\(EVA\) support and traceability.) Tj T* ET
